Helios Observatory
Copyright 2026 Helios Observatory Contributors

This product includes software developed by the Helios Observatory project
(https://github.com/spearchucker667/Helios-Observatory).

This project incorporates astronomical ephemeris algorithms, orbital elements,
and planetary constants derived from public domain and open access data published by:
- National Aeronautics and Space Administration (NASA)
- Jet Propulsion Laboratory (JPL) Solar System Dynamics Group
- International Astronomical Union (IAU) Minor Planet Center (MPC)
- NASA Horizons System and Planetary Data System (PDS)
- New Horizons Science Team (Pluto and Charon encounter datasets)
